And Thropic launched its first-focused AI for science grants, offering clawed usage credits,

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.900
specifically for rare disease work. Several new ARC's papers introduce practical benchmarks

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.460
and libraries for small models, legal reasoning, and efficient inference. Watch for how these credits

