Today's announcement extends closed model access to specialized scientific users and tests

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:10.040
whether credit-based programs can move capability to impact questions forward. And Thropic announced

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:16.460
grants of up to $50,000 in clawed usage credits for researchers working on rare disease cures.

